(text
"Only ISOLATED SECONDARY signals reach this connector. No HOST ground is carried in this harness.\n1 PACK_POS, 2 GND, 3 pack NTC, 4 CHG_CE, 5 isolated USB5, 6 CHG_PG. Match power-board J1204 pin-for-pin.\nR607/R608 hold CE high during acquisition. Daughterboard R1205 defaults CE high if the harness/CE wire is open.\nPOWER switch now controls the battery MOSFET gate logic; it does not carry battery load current.\nR1206 discharges switched VBAT after OFF; charging begins only after CE falls below its threshold.\nDo not charge while connected to a person: physically unplug every electrode, including REF and BIAS.\nUse a keyed insulated GH6 harness, rated >=1A, target length <=50mm. Validate pin order before connecting cells."
(at
20.32
139.7
0)
